    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A beautifully maintained and exceptionally tidy farmhouse set in a peaceful country setting in Termonfeckin, just outside Drogheda. The property offers a wonderful blend of rural charm, character and practical living, with a range of additional storage sheds and a detached one-bedroom apartment situated on the grounds, offering excellent potential for guests, family accommodation or independent living. A cleverly converted shed also provides a cosy private bar — an ideal space for entertaining and relaxing. The mature gardens are a particular feature, with established trees, beautiful planting and well-kept outdoor spaces creating a private and welcoming setting. Offering the tranquillity of country living while remaining conveniently connected to Drogheda and the surrounding transport links, this is a versatile and charming property that combines space, character and an enviable rural lifestyle. Briefly, this is a quality home in a prime family location within easy access of Drogheda Town Centre and the M1 Motorway, all within a 10 minute drive. Viewing is advised. \n\nAMV 575,000 For Sale by Private Treaty.\n\nFeatures:\n\n3 Bedroom Detached House \nAdditional Storage Sheds \nPrivate Bar Converted Shed \nC. 1.31 Acre Site \nBuilt C. 1900 \nHouse Extends to c. 120 sq .m ( 1292 sq. ft) \nApartment Extends to c.51.5 sq. m \nO-F-C-H \nMulti Fuel Stove \nPVC Double Glazing \nWaste BIO Cycle Unit \nWater - Mains Water \nAmple Parking \n\n \nAccommodation Includes \nEntrance Hall \nLounge / Dining(4.88m x 6.15m)\nKitchen(4.50m x 4.88m) \nGuest WC(1.30m x 1.55m) \n \n\n1st Floor :\n\nLanding \nBedroom 1(4.88m x 3.27m) \nEn Suite(1.70m x 1.85m) \nBedroom 2(2.07m x 4.81m) \nBedroom 3(2.98m x 3.00m) \nMain Bathroom(2.10m x 2.88m) \n \n\n1 Bedroom Detached Apartment:\n\nLiving/Kitchen(2.65m x 4.85m) \nBedroom(3.25m x 2.65m) \nBathroom(2.65m x 1.76m) \n\n \nOutside:\n\nShed 1(9.00m x 14.5m) \nShed 2(6.71m x 5.33m) \nShed 3(5.05m x 5.33m) \nShed 4(6.81m x 5.33m) \n\nUtility (2.42m x 3.75m) \n\nPrivate Bar(5.11m x 4.21m) \n\nBuilding Energy Rating \nBER: C3 \nBER No. 112467055 \nEnergy Performance Indicator: 215.18 kWh/m²/yr \n \nViewing Details: \nStrictly by appointment with the sole selling agent."
